camera-sign (0.1.0+git20261004.bee06e8-1~ppa1~ubuntu26.04.1) resolute; urgency=medium

  * New upstream snapshot, from git bee06e8 (2026-10-04).
    - Light the sign while an Android phone's camera is in use too, read
      over adb, by USB or Wi-Fi: set CAMERA_SIGN_PHONE (or --phone) to the
      phone's adb serial or address:port.
    - "camera-sign phone on|off" switches watching the phone, in a running
      watcher as well, without a restart.
  * debian/control: Suggests adb.
  * debian/README.Debian: point to the phone setup in README.md.

